@startuml
state Idle [*]
state SelectAmount
state CustomAmount
state Verification
state Rejected
state Retry
state Success

Idle -> SelectAmount: User selects an amount
Idle -> CustomAmount: User chooses to enter a custom value
SelectAmount or CustomAmount -> Verification: User submits the amount
Verification -> Rejected: Transaction is rejected
Rejected -> Retry: User decides to retry entering the amount
Verification -> Success: Transaction is successful
@enduml
